#: ../../source/module/nep-display-open-data.md:3 458532715cd8430ba36691c3b463d4fd
msgid ""
"这一页对应软件顶部区域。第一次进入 `NEP Dataset Display` 时，先从这里确认页面布局、 输入类型、`Open` / `Save` 菜单和 NEP "
"模型切换方式。"
msgstr ""
"This page covers the top area of the application. When you first open `NEP Dataset "
"Display`, use it to understand the layout, input types, `Open` / `Save` menus, and "
"how to switch NEP models."

