msgid "左侧：误差散点主图区（descriptor / energy / force / pressure / potential energy 等子图）。"
msgstr "Left: main error-scatter area, with descriptor, energy, force, pressure, potential-energy, and related plots."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:162 0901b293f8244df09f58697c8491df1b
msgid "右侧：结构区（3D 结构、结构信息、最短键长、净力、索引与播放）。"
msgstr "Right: structure area with the 3D view, structure information, shortest bond length, net force, index controls, and playback."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:163 4699ab9ddbc04acfa892b2c795722951
msgid "底部：数据状态行 `Orig / Now / Rm / Sel / Unsel / Rej`。"
msgstr "Bottom: dataset status row showing `Orig / Now / Rm / Sel / Unsel / Rej`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:164 321740f304304bc19b40f6f3a0eb22de
