msgstr "Use an export action such as `Export All...`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-open-data.md:4254 7e7e47a0e00d4cc796cbc6fe715e5ed8
msgid "先选 `ExportFormat`，再选保存路径"
msgstr "Choose `ExportFormat` first, then choose the save path"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10668
#: fd830aa685a74da0a76b60a1b2161b2d
msgid "5. 导入导出与 NEP 模型切换"
msgstr "5. Importing, exporting, and switching NEP models"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10670
#: a03cd89322424703b75a3fe3e72b7f3f
msgid "5.1 导入"
msgstr "5.1 Import"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10672
#: 827f7183f1c64fdc8cce9166f499462c
msgid "`Open File...`：选择 `*.xyz`。"
msgstr "`Open File...`: choose `*.xyz`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10673
#: 6777b819c6844a239582d38edaca30aa
msgid "`Open Folder...`：选择目录（`deepmd/npy` 常见）。"
msgstr "`Open Folder...`: choose a directory (commonly `deepmd/npy`)."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10674
#: 37cd9171fbf3440da60306a5b4b044d8
msgid "拖拽：仅接受 `matches_result_loader()` 支持的路径。"
msgstr "Drag and drop: only paths supported by `matches_result_loader()` are accepted."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10675
#: 66e462c8129545d09333cc15d8de25dc
msgid "若已有工作路径，切换前会二次确认。"
msgstr ""
"If a working path is already loaded, the application asks for confirmation before "
"switching."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10676
#: dbb97350b37745a7b40020c5c701b7c2
msgid "加载过程在后台线程执行；`StateToolTip` 可触发取消。"
msgstr "Loading runs in a background thread; `StateToolTip` can trigger cancellation."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10678
#: c9ebeab919624c18bc3e4852faeb4e1e
msgid "5.2 导出菜单（顶栏 Save）"
msgstr "5.2 Export menu (top-bar Save)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10680
#: 15fcbd58ca80497195296a17c12e79c7
msgid "动作：`Export All / Selected / Removed / Active`。"
msgstr "Actions: `Export All / Selected / Removed / Active`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10681
#: 0eab15276836432a8a996c40450c751e
msgid "启用条件：数据已加载且非 busy；其中 `Selected/Removed/Active` 要求计数大于 0。"
msgstr ""
"Enabled when data is loaded and the application is not busy; "
"`Selected/Removed/Active` also require a count greater than 0."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10682
#: 91aec8cb1ac1409cb85993792ed1a6f8
msgid "统一先选 `ExportFormat`，再选路径。"
msgstr "Always choose `ExportFormat` first, then choose the path."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10684
#: c985725cdf9c4b539a9450b9b35b7755
msgid "![Export Menu](../_static/image/show_nep/m_export_menu.png)"
msgstr "![Export Menu](../_static/image/show_nep/m_export_menu.png)"

