#: 2587f867b2044b53b2a55412ed74bfde
msgid "5.3 NEP 模型切换（路径栏右侧下拉框）"
msgstr "5.3 Switching NEP models (drop-down at the right of the path bar)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10688
#: 6739294644d949b2b9be9d6733d88efe
msgid "文件发现：扫描当前目录 `*.txt` 且文件名含 `nep`。"
msgstr "File discovery: scan the current directory for `*.txt` files whose names contain `nep`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10689
#: a57917e700174ba0838535418195ccfb
msgid "排序规则：`nep.txt` 优先，其余按字母序；最后可追加内置 `nep89`。"
msgstr "Ordering: list `nep.txt` first, sort the remaining files alphabetically, and optionally append the bundled `nep89` model."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10690
#: 9850bd7d7a254cae86c43a641e856178
msgid "切换策略：优先命中缓存（`_nep_result_cache`）；未命中时异步重载。"
msgstr "Switching strategy: reuse `_nep_result_cache` when possible; otherwise reload asynchronously."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10691
#: 39a71de38e7f48b7899c24e6c0cc8935
msgid "状态保持：切换后恢复 `selected` 与 `reject`。"
msgstr "State preservation: restore `selected` and `reject` after switching models."

